ing","gap_id":"gap_733_lab_ops","missing_source_classes":["实验室手册或检验操作规程","样本采集与处理要求"],"target":"7.3.3 实验室检查——检测安排与样本处理"},{"action":"补充实验室检查异常值的临床意义判定与处理规则文件。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_733_abnormal","missing_source_classes":["实验室异常值管理文件"],"target":"7.3.3 实验室检查——异常值判定与处理"},{"action":"明确筛选期实验室检查项目清单及其与排除标准判定（HbA1c、泌尿系感染）的对应关系。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_733_screening_panel","missing_source_classes":["筛选期实验室检查项目文件"],"target":"7.3.3 实验室检查——筛选期检查项目"}],"heading":"实验室检查","missing_source_classes":["实验室手册或检验操作规程","样本采集与处理要求","实验室异常值管理文件","筛选期实验室检查项目文件"],"proposal_text":"临床实验室检查是本研究安全性评价的组成部分，包括血常规、血生化与尿常规，安排在基线（V1，第1天）及第8周（V3/EOT）进行采集。筛选期存在未控制的糖尿病（HbA1c>8.5%）或泌尿系活动性感染的受试者按排除标准不予入组。实验室检查结果将与其他安全性数据一并纳入安全性分析，并在安全性分析集（SS）中按描述性统计进行汇总，以支持对治疗期间实验室安全性变化的评价。","rationale":"依据已确认研究事实：临床实验室检查含血常规、血生化、尿常规，于基线与第8周采集，分别对应V1（第1天）与V3/EOT（第8周）；未控制的糖尿病（HbA1c>8.5%）与泌尿系活动性感染为排除标准；安全性在SS集按描述性汇总。医学经理需核对检测实验室、样本采集处理与运输、参考范围及异常值判定规则是否有项目文件支持。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_182aa223063a9ea2","section_number":"7.3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:290201c28a5ff8e3fd54cafd","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260929215858_23ce20eb","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_4a05ffc7d3f96141:full-draft:290201c28a5ff8e3fd54cafd","quote":"章节编号=7.3.4\n章节标题=妊娠检查和避孕问询","quote_sha256":"75b639c910a64012ed0e81790f0dd82b93094dc94cc1d8797af7c0e7b9bc8367","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:290201c28a5ff8e3fd54cafd","span_id":"esp_s1_sec734"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"18-80岁男性或绝经后/有避孕措施的女性","quote_sha256":"0daf69b0932996f75d47a067955feb8ae6acd3b276aa699554105eba1c4b3070","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"esp_s2_inclusion_women"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"筛选期QTcF>450ms；妊娠或哺乳期","quote_sha256":"37f01e3ad08974f14e4ce2a823d21ca6ab38cc07de4415818740e74e19e9f25f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"esp_s2_preg_excl"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["esp_s1_sec734","esp_s2_inclusion_women","esp_s2_preg_excl"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充妊娠检查方法（如血/尿妊娠试验）与检查时点的项目文件。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_734_test_method","missing_source_classes":["妊娠检查实施方案文件"],"target":"7.3.4 妊娠检查和避孕问询——检查方法与实施安排"},{"action":"补充可接受避孕方法的定义与问询要素。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_734_contraception","missing_source_classes":["避孕措施与妊娠预防文件"],"target":"7.3.4 妊娠检查和避孕问询——避孕要求"},{"action":"补充妊娠事件处理、伴侣妊娠报告与随访安排的项目文件。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_734_pregnancy_handling","missing_source_classes":["妊娠事件处理与随访流程文件"],"target":"7.3.4 妊娠检查和避孕问询——妊娠事件处理"},{"action":"补充哺乳期受试者识别与管理要求的项目文件。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_734_lactation","missing_source_classes":["哺乳期管理文件"],"target":"7.3.4 妊娠检查和避孕问询——哺乳期管理"}],"heading":"妊娠检查和避孕问询","missing_source_classes":["妊娠检查实施方案文件","避孕措施与妊娠预防文件","妊娠事件处理与随访流程文件","哺乳期管理文件"],"proposal_text":"本研究入选18-80岁男性，以及绝经后女性或采取避孕措施的女性；妊娠期或哺乳期女性按排除标准不予入组。妊娠检查和避孕问询针对女性受试者开展，用于确认受试者的妊娠状态及避孕情况，为判断其是否符合上述入选与排除要求提供依据，并支持研究期间对妊娠或哺乳状态的识别。","rationale":"依据已确认研究事实：入选标准为18-80岁男性或绝经后/有避孕措施的女性；妊娠或哺乳期为排除标准。医学经理需依据妊娠检查与避孕管理相关项目文件补充检查方法与时点、可接受避孕方法、妊娠事件处理及随访等内容。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_24ec9c9c003b60b8","section_number":"7.3.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:290201c28a5ff8e3fd54cafd","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260929215858_23ce20eb","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_4a05ffc7d3f96141:full-draft:290201c28a5ff8e3fd54cafd","quote":"章节编号=8\n章节标题=安全性评价","quote_sha256":"3ff161f4933ee3f7f658c4ec2f350776528971594de4dce073030dafb9175560","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:290201c28a5ff8e3fd54cafd","span_id":"esp_s1_sec8"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE发生率与严重程度（全治疗期随访）；生命体征与体重（每次访视）；12导联心电图与QTc（基线、第4周、第8周）；临床实验室检查（血常规、血生化、尿常规，基线与第8周）；残余尿量（B超，基线与第8周）","quote_sha256":"66c6ed21768e222442148668c8e011f2fdd1d5362d40c19cd49dd66faeaf5df6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"esp_s2_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"研究时期：筛选期≤2周；8周双盲治疗期；2周治疗结束后安全性随访期","quote_sha256":"f2a56dc5950ddeb482760193799fe5096a95ff1f5f171512dee0c42bbaa14b20","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"esp_s2_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"随访（第10周，安全性随访）","quote_sha256":"84d6a9cae31fdb9f812d4173955732e616a87561deb006d7549952f73ad72d78","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"esp_s2_followup_visit"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"安全性采用SS集描述性汇总","quote_sha256":"0c8710884217f46dc4dbdadbbe808da301a10b42b6787e655f57b2fc8ac6e13f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"esp_s2_safety_analysis"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"近3个月内膀胱肉毒毒素注射或膀胱灌注治疗；压力性尿失禁为主或混合性尿失禁以压力性为主；残留尿>200mL或尿潴留史；未控制的糖尿病（HbA1c>8.5%）或泌尿系活动性感染；筛选期QTcF>450ms；妊娠或哺乳期","quote_sha256":"a90449619e4a691f5f16ec99faf35953ec94d818b90db18ab6cc626c9b3bf4e6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"esp_s2_exclusions"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["esp_s1_sec8","esp_s2_safety_endpoints","esp_s2_periods","esp_s2_followup_visit","esp_s2_safety_analysis","esp_s2_exclusions"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充AE/SAE/SUSAR定义、采集与报告要求（报告对象、时限与随访）的项目文件。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_8_ae_reporting","missing_source_classes":["不良事件管理文件（AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与报告要求）"],"target":"第8章 安全性评价——不良事件定义与报告"},{"action":"补充剂量调整、暂停、恢复、永久停药以及药物过量与给药错误的判断、处理与报告要求。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_8_dose_and_overdose","missing_source_classes":["用药异常管理文件（剂量调整、暂停、恢复、永久停药、药物过量与给药错误处理）"],"target":"第8章 安全性评价——剂量调整、停药与用药异常处理"},{"action":"补充研究药物作用机制相关风险、非临床与既往临床安全性资料。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_8_drug_risk","missing_source_classes":["研究药物风险资料（研究者手册等）"],"target":"第8章 安全性评价——研究药物风险信息"},{"action":"补充安全性评估窗口及研究结束时点的定义文件。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_8_windows","missing_source_classes":["安全性评估窗口与研究结束定义文件"],"target":"第8章 安全性评价——安全性评估窗口与研究结束定义"}],"heading":"安全性评价","missing_source_classes":["不良事件管理文件（AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与报告要求）","用药异常管理文件（剂量调整、暂停、恢复、永久停药、药物过量与给药错误处理）","研究药物风险资料（研究者手册等）","安全性评估窗口与研究结束定义文件"],"proposal_text":"本研究的安全性评价基于以下安全性终点开展：TEAE发生率与严重程度（全治疗期随访）；生命体征与体重（每次访视）；12导联心电图与QTc（基线、第4周、第8周）；临床实验室检查（血常规、血生化、尿常规，基线与第8周）；残余尿量（B超，基线与第8周）。研究时期包括筛选期（不超过2周）、8周双盲治疗期和2周治疗结束后安全性随访期，其中安全性随访访视安排在第10周。为控制潜在安全性风险，筛选期QTcF>450ms、残余尿量>200mL或尿潴留史、未控制的糖尿病（HbA1c>8.5%）或泌尿系活动性感染等情形被列入排除标准。安全性数据的统计分析在安全性分析集（SS）中按描述性方法汇总。","rationale":"依据已确认研究事实：安全性终点覆盖TEAE（全治疗期随访）、生命体征与体重（每次访视）、心电图与QTc（基线、第4周、第8周）、临床实验室检查（基线与第8周）及残余尿量（B超，基线与第8周）；研究时期含8周双盲治疗期与2周治疗结束后安全性随访期，安全性随访在第10周；安全相关排除标准包括筛选期QTcF>450ms、残余尿量>200mL或尿潴留史、未控制的糖尿病（HbA1c>8.5%）及泌尿系活动性感染；安全性在SS集按描述性汇总。医学经理需核对不良事件定义与报告、剂量调整与停药、药物过量与给药错误处理及研究药物风险是否有对应项目文件支持。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_953764b4a81b317d","section_number":"8","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:290201c28a5ff8e3fd54cafd","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"45ef9cd716e7fdf9c661aea78a6fba9c0abd874974b98669fb34a5ed0e3df7e2","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_4a05ffc7d3f96141:full-draft:290201c28a5ff8e3fd54cafd","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:290201c28a5ff8e3fd54cafd","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:d3b18d3c5bc2f2e1d9d8c0eb4f67a10dedd24555da25190a36aa87465b6205da:290201c28a5ff8e3fd54cafd","text_sha256":"45ef9cd716e7fdf9c661aea78a6fba9c0abd874974b98669fb34a5ed0e3df7e2"},{"content_sha256":"0635eea7669b672f07d424c62f5ada3e697f6bccfa75757cfda10bc04faa81b2","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","text_sha256":"0635eea7669b672f07d424c62f5ada3e697f6bccfa75757cfda10bc04faa81b2"}]}